I think the escort uniform suits you best.

293
00:19:43,640 --> 00:19:44,279
Yeah.

294
00:19:44,440 --> 00:19:45,480
It doesn't fit me.

295
00:19:45,480 --> 00:19:47,240
I only look good in the escort uniform.

296
00:19:53,119 --> 00:19:55,200
Why did you suddenly think of buying this?

297
00:19:56,119 --> 00:19:56,880
It's from Bai.

298
00:19:57,000 --> 00:19:57,759
What?

299
00:19:58,200 --> 00:19:58,960
That Bai Yanli,

300
00:19:58,960 --> 00:20:00,119
the ingrate, has come back?

301
00:20:02,240 --> 00:20:03,240
You let him come back?

302
00:20:03,640 --> 00:20:05,880
When do I need your permission?

303
00:20:05,880 --> 00:20:06,880
Why don't you?

304
00:20:07,039 --> 00:20:07,960
I'm your husband.

305
00:20:07,960 --> 00:20:08,839
You're my wife.

306
00:20:08,839 --> 00:20:09,519
It's a contract.

307
00:20:09,519 --> 00:20:10,000
Temporary.

308
00:20:10,000 --> 00:20:10,640
Fake.

309
00:20:10,640 --> 00:20:12,200
I'm not as self-righteous as you.

310
00:20:12,240 --> 00:20:13,640
I don't care about your business.

311
00:20:15,480 --> 00:20:15,839
I...

312
00:20:21,680 --> 00:20:22,720
Something's wrong.

313
00:20:22,920 --> 00:20:24,039
We'd better go.

314
00:20:24,359 --> 00:20:25,880
Hurry up.

315
00:20:26,119 --> 00:20:27,799
I said no.

316
00:20:27,880 --> 00:20:28,839
How can you refuse?

317
00:20:29,279 --> 00:20:31,039
I don't want to go.

318
00:20:33,400 --> 00:20:34,480
Even your brother has come around.

319
00:20:34,480 --> 00:20:35,640
Why are you still so stubborn?

320
00:20:36,720 --> 00:20:37,599
You and my brother,

321
00:20:37,720 --> 00:20:39,240
you two are in love.

322
00:20:39,480 --> 00:20:40,880
What am I to Cheng Qi?

323
00:20:44,200 --> 00:20:45,880
You're doing this for the agency?

324
00:20:47,920 --> 00:20:48,480
What do you mean?

325
00:20:49,759 --> 00:20:52,960
The guests are all dignitaries in Yunjing.

326
00:20:53,440 --> 00:20:54,839
Knowing you're Cheng Qi's wife,

327
00:20:54,880 --> 00:20:56,400
they'll support the business.

328
00:20:57,440 --> 00:20:58,680
Really?

329
00:20:59,240 --> 00:21:01,119
You did it for the business last time.

330
00:21:02,599 --> 00:21:04,640
I did it for the business.

331
00:21:04,759 --> 00:21:05,519
Exactly.

332
00:21:05,960 --> 00:21:07,160
Go back and get ready.

333
00:21:24,039 --> 00:21:24,960
Mr. Cheng,

334
00:21:25,160 --> 00:21:26,799
Why are you here alone?

335
00:21:26,880 --> 00:21:28,519
Where's your wife?

336
00:21:28,720 --> 00:21:29,680
Wife?

337
00:21:30,640 --> 00:21:33,440
Mr. Cheng, you have a unique taste.

338
00:21:33,720 --> 00:21:36,119
You know, Mr. Cheng is a live-in son-in-law.

339
00:21:36,400 --> 00:21:37,319
Unlike you and me,

340
00:21:37,599 --> 00:21:40,240
whose wives are noble and elegant.

341
00:21:40,920 --> 00:21:43,440
Most escorts are rough and rude.

342
00:21:44,000 --> 00:21:45,799
Mr. Cheng, you must have been bullied

343
00:21:46,000 --> 00:21:47,440
in the escort agency, right?

344
00:21:48,519 --> 00:21:50,440
My wife treats me very well.

345
00:21:50,799 --> 00:21:52,079
No bullying at all.

346
00:21:52,839 --> 00:21:53,640
She just

347
00:21:53,759 --> 00:21:55,880
doesn't like this kind of occasion.

348
00:21:57,319 --> 00:22:00,599
Do you dislike me bringing you out?

349
00:22:14,759 --> 00:22:15,200
This...

350
00:22:16,000 --> 00:22:17,599
Is this the attire of the Cheng family?

351
00:22:19,000 --> 00:22:21,160
How can you come to the banquet

352
00:22:22,440 --> 00:22:23,720
in such shabby clothes?

353
00:22:24,839 --> 00:22:26,599
Is Mr. Cheng stingy

354
00:22:26,759 --> 00:22:28,839
or just inexperienced?

355
00:22:28,839 --> 00:22:29,799
Why are you here?

356
00:22:30,640 --> 00:22:31,759
Can't I come?

357
00:22:32,799 --> 00:22:33,640
Or

358
00:22:33,880 --> 00:22:34,720
you think I'm embarrassing?

359
00:22:35,200 --> 00:22:35,839
No.

360
00:22:36,039 --> 00:22:38,279
You said you didn't like coming here.

361
00:22:38,599 --> 00:22:39,720
You didn't ask.

362
00:22:39,880 --> 00:22:41,079
How do you know I don't like it?

363
00:22:41,960 --> 00:22:43,160
OK, my fault.

364
00:22:43,400 --> 00:22:45,319
Thank you for coming here with me.

365
00:22:47,039 --> 00:22:48,319
I didn't come for you.

366
00:22:50,200 --> 00:22:51,759
You're really henpecked.

367
00:22:51,880 --> 00:22:53,920
Not as heroic as

368
00:22:54,119 --> 00:22:55,400
your poems.

369
00:22:56,240 --> 00:22:57,039
Mr. Ling,

370
00:22:57,400 --> 00:23:00,000
you don't know what respect means.

371
00:23:00,640 --> 00:23:01,640
Thank you for the compliment.

372
00:23:08,559 --> 00:23:10,720
I've had a headache these days.

373
00:23:11,119 --> 00:23:12,240
My husband

374
00:23:12,400 --> 00:23:15,400
bought me a lot of bird's nest

375
00:23:15,640 --> 00:23:17,200
and shark fin,

376
00:23:17,200 --> 00:23:18,720
saying it would nourish me.

377
00:23:18,880 --> 00:23:20,480
I've gained so much weight

378
00:23:20,640 --> 00:23:24,400
that I can't even fit into my hairpin.

379
00:23:27,279 --> 00:23:28,200
My dear,

380
00:23:28,400 --> 00:23:29,720
it's quite a coincidence.

381
00:23:30,559 --> 00:23:32,559
I'm weak,

382
00:23:32,839 --> 00:23:33,799
so my husband

383
00:23:33,799 --> 00:23:36,319
bought me deer antlers and ginseng.

384
00:23:36,440 --> 00:23:37,279
Look,

385
00:23:37,720 --> 00:23:40,559
it's causing me to get all heated up.

386
00:23:43,160 --> 00:23:45,599
Your husbands are so thoughtful,

387
00:23:46,319 --> 00:23:47,880
Unlike my husband,

388
00:23:48,000 --> 00:23:50,519
who only buys me jewelry.

389
00:23:50,640 --> 00:23:51,480
He doesn't care

390
00:23:51,720 --> 00:23:53,240
about anything else.

391
00:23:54,400 --> 00:23:55,519
In my opinion,

392
00:23:55,640 --> 00:23:57,839
Lady Cheng is unique.

393
00:23:58,240 --> 00:24:00,440
Dressing like a constable,

394
00:24:00,720 --> 00:24:03,640
truly eye-opening.

395
00:24:05,119 --> 00:24:07,720
This is clearly a gathering of scholars.

396
00:24:09,079 --> 00:24:10,480
Being late is one thing,

397
00:24:10,480 --> 00:24:12,400
But this outfit and behavior,

398
00:24:12,440 --> 00:24:14,480
it's truly unprecedented.

399
00:24:15,720 --> 00:24:17,480
Mr. Cheng's talent

400
00:24:17,480 --> 00:24:20,279
must be forced out, right?

401
00:24:21,200 --> 00:24:22,240
Don't you think?

402
00:24:44,200 --> 00:24:47,279
My wife is different from you ladies,

403
00:24:48,000 --> 00:24:49,839
who can only rely on your husbands.

404
00:24:50,799 --> 00:24:53,079
Like sparrows confined within a boudoir.

405
00:24:54,319 --> 00:24:56,759
How can sparrows know the ambitions of swans?

406
00:24:58,160 --> 00:24:59,039
It's normal

407
00:24:59,400 --> 00:25:00,720
not to have seen it.

408
00:25:03,039 --> 00:25:03,920
What does he mean?

409
00:25:04,039 --> 00:25:05,240
Say something!

410
00:25:06,400 --> 00:25:08,119
I'm a canary, aren't I?

411
00:25:08,720 --> 00:25:09,200
Shut up.

412
00:25:14,640 --> 00:25:17,200
You are invited here today

413
00:25:17,319 --> 00:25:19,759
to express my gratitude.

414
00:25:22,400 --> 00:25:24,200
The Starry Night Auction

415
00:25:25,319 --> 00:25:26,920
was a success because of you.

416
00:25:28,720 --> 00:25:30,240
We are honored

417
00:25:30,240 --> 00:25:31,240
to be selected for the final.

418
00:25:31,440 --> 00:25:32,880
We don't need your gratitude.

419
00:25:44,319 --> 00:25:47,039
How's the money going?

420
00:25:47,599 --> 00:25:48,359
My lord,

421
00:25:48,559 --> 00:25:49,440
it's on its way.

422
00:25:49,640 --> 00:25:50,880
It'll be here on time,

423
00:25:51,200 --> 00:25:52,240
I promise.

424
00:25:53,440 --> 00:25:54,799
But...

425
00:25:55,039 --> 00:25:55,759
Speak.

426
00:25:57,640 --> 00:25:59,400
I've been escorting goods lately,

427
00:25:59,720 --> 00:26:02,039
and the Su's Escort Agency

428
00:26:02,319 --> 00:26:03,839
is stealing my business.

429
00:26:05,480 --> 00:26:06,640
My lord, don't get me wrong.

430
00:26:06,880 --> 00:26:08,400
I'm not asking for money.

431
00:26:09,440 --> 00:26:11,400
My dad and I are thinking about

432
00:26:11,839 --> 00:26:13,359
merging with them.

433
00:26:14,519 --> 00:26:18,319
So we can help you in the future.

434
00:26:21,079 --> 00:26:22,319
Don't lose the forest for the trees.

435
00:26:24,640 --> 00:26:25,519
Understood.

436
00:26:26,039 --> 00:26:27,319
Thank you, my lord.

437
00:26:34,680 --> 00:26:36,480
To be honest,

438
00:26:36,720 --> 00:26:38,960
Mr. Ling's poetry

439
00:26:38,960 --> 00:26:40,359
is well-crafted.

440
00:26:40,359 --> 00:26:41,519
and worth learning from.

441
00:26:42,000 --> 00:26:42,839
You're too kind.

442
00:26:43,079 --> 00:26:45,720
Mr. Cheng's work is more commendable.

443
00:26:48,000 --> 00:26:49,839
The Starry Gathering is full of talent.

444
00:26:50,640 --> 00:26:51,559
This banquet

445
00:26:51,559 --> 00:26:53,720
is also thanks to Ms. Zhang's support.

446
00:26:54,079 --> 00:26:55,079
Don't you think?

447
00:26:55,640 --> 00:26:58,480
Without the support of the Grand Preceptor and Ms. Zhang,

448
00:26:58,480 --> 00:27:00,039
we wouldn't be here.

449
00:27:00,039 --> 00:27:01,039
It's my duty.

450
00:27:01,160 --> 00:27:02,240
I hope both of you

451
00:27:02,240 --> 00:27:04,240
can show your best in the final.

452
00:27:04,640 --> 00:27:05,839
Thanks for your good wishes.

453
00:27:07,079 --> 00:27:08,240
Don't you think

454
00:27:08,559 --> 00:27:09,920
Miss Zhang

455
00:27:10,200 --> 00:27:13,599
is treating Mr. Cheng differently?

456
00:27:16,039 --> 00:27:17,440
Just now,

457
00:27:17,440 --> 00:27:19,240
Miss Zhang was

458
00:27:19,480 --> 00:27:21,160
always concerned about him.

459
00:27:21,160 --> 00:27:22,079
Yeah.

460
00:27:23,480 --> 00:27:24,839
Mr. Cheng is so talented.

461
00:27:26,240 --> 00:27:29,200
Is Miss Zhang helping him

462
00:27:29,480 --> 00:27:30,720
because she has a crush on you?

463
00:27:33,440 --> 00:27:36,200
Ms. Zhang is the best

464
00:27:36,279 --> 00:27:37,079
in appearance,

465
00:27:37,319 --> 00:27:38,160
family background,

466
00:27:38,720 --> 00:27:40,160
and property

467
00:27:40,160 --> 00:27:42,240
in the entire Yun State.

468
00:27:42,640 --> 00:27:44,240
A beauty matches a talent.

469
00:27:44,920 --> 00:27:46,400
If I were you,

470
00:27:46,680 --> 00:27:49,359
I would also want to marry her.

471
00:27:49,640 --> 00:27:50,400
Would I

472
00:27:50,480 --> 00:27:53,519
still stick to that vulgar escort?

473
00:27:54,880 --> 00:27:56,039
That's right.

474
00:27:56,960 --> 00:27:58,240
You, you...

475
00:28:17,039 --> 00:28:17,599
My lady,

476
00:28:18,039 --> 00:28:18,880
what happened?

477
00:28:24,319 --> 00:28:25,519
What's going on?

478
00:28:25,759 --> 00:28:26,200
Yeah.

479
00:28:32,480 --> 00:28:33,799
I want to eat fruits.

480
00:28:35,119 --> 00:28:35,839
Do you want some?

481
00:28:46,079 --> 00:28:46,519
Watch out!

482
00:28:53,039 --> 00:28:53,519
My lady.

483
00:28:54,279 --> 00:28:55,559
My wife is very strong.

484
00:28:55,759 --> 00:28:56,680
I'm sorry.

485
00:28:57,480 --> 00:28:58,039
It's okay.

486
00:28:59,440 --> 00:29:01,680
Since you like fruits,

487
00:29:02,400 --> 00:29:04,039
I'll have someone pick more.

488
00:29:04,039 --> 00:29:04,400
No need.

489
00:29:10,799 --> 00:29:11,680
I'm sorry for being rude.

490
00:29:11,960 --> 00:29:12,680
I'm sorry.

491
00:29:16,720 --> 00:29:17,599
I should go back to the escort agency.

492
00:29:18,720 --> 00:29:19,279
Goodbye.

493
00:29:24,720 --> 00:29:25,240
Miss

494
00:29:25,480 --> 00:29:27,880
I'm really worried about my wife going home alone.

495
00:29:28,319 --> 00:29:29,839
I'll make it up to you another day.

496
00:30:22,240 --> 00:30:23,519
You can't drink,

497
00:30:24,200 --> 00:30:25,119
why do you force yourself?

498
00:30:26,319 --> 00:30:26,920
You...

499
00:30:27,720 --> 00:30:29,559
Do you think

500
00:30:29,759 --> 00:30:32,119
I've embarrassed you?

501
00:30:32,599 --> 00:30:33,319
No, I don't.

502
00:30:35,119 --> 00:30:36,160
I just think

503
00:30:37,400 --> 00:30:38,839
you're amazing today.

504
00:30:39,519 --> 00:30:41,000
You scared those ladies

505
00:30:41,359 --> 00:30:42,640
to run away.

506
00:30:43,000 --> 00:30:43,839
It's so satisfying.

507
00:30:44,640 --> 00:30:45,440
Then...

508
00:30:46,200 --> 00:30:48,880
Then why did you help Zhang Xiayun?

509
00:30:49,880 --> 00:30:51,519
Do you think

510
00:30:52,119 --> 00:30:53,839
I'm not as good as her?

511
00:30:54,319 --> 00:30:56,119
So she's been jealous all along.

512
00:31:02,720 --> 00:31:03,720
Silly girl.

513
00:31:04,640 --> 00:31:05,799
In my heart,

514
00:31:06,640 --> 00:31:08,200
you are the best.

515
00:31:10,119 --> 00:31:11,680
Who is the best?

516
00:31:13,519 --> 00:31:15,640
Su Yuejiao is the best.

517
00:31:16,119 --> 00:31:17,240
Good for you.

518
00:31:18,599 --> 00:31:19,960
You are the best, too.

519
00:31:20,440 --> 00:31:23,720
Then I'll help you with your lines.

520
00:31:25,480 --> 00:31:26,519
You said it.

521
00:31:26,839 --> 00:31:27,680
You can't go back on your word.

522
00:31:28,640 --> 00:31:32,960
Su's Escort Agency always keeps its word.

523
00:31:35,519 --> 00:31:36,559
Okay.

524
00:31:36,559 --> 00:31:38,519
Don't forget it when you wake up tomorrow.

525
00:31:38,920 --> 00:31:41,359
Don't worry. I won't forget.
